    "notes": "Set League of Legends to Borderless window mode. Hexsight runs in portable mode: your data is in the Hexsight-data folder, which Scoop keeps across updates. Hexsight isn't endorsed by Riot Games. See the README for the full notice.",
    "url": "https://github.com/bard58/hexsight/releases/download/v0.1.0/hexsight-v0.1.0-windows-x64-portable.zip",
